  "content_html": "<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><a href=\"/assets/images/content/0352cbb60e412587c1.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em; text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"רישום של ילד עם כובע מצחייה\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"291\" data-original-width=\"219\" src=\"/assets/images/content/0352cbb60e412587c1.png\" /></a></p><h2><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🎈&nbsp;</span><span data-end=\"108\" data-start=\"73\" style=\"font-family: arial;\">שיחה בציורים - יַלְדֵי מַחֲנֵה יִשְׂרָאֵל</span></span></h2><div><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"158\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🦁 <b>יְהוּדָה<br /></b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בַּשֵּׁבֶט שֶׁלִּי - כ</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;74 אֶלֶף אֲנָשִׁים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנַחְנוּ גִּבּוֹרִים כְּמוֹ אֲרָיוֹת.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְחוֹנִים בְּצַד מִזְרָח&nbsp;</span>🏳️<span style=\"font-family: arial;\">.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"158\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>יִשָּׂשכָר</b><br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בַּשֵּׁבֶט שֶׁלִּי - כ</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;54 אֶלֶף אֲנָשִׁים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנַחְנוּ יוֹדְעִים לִקְבֹּעַ זְמַנִּים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְחוֹנִים בְּצַד מִזְרָח&nbsp;</span>🏳️&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בְּהַנְהָגַת 🦁 יְהוּדָה.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"158\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🚢 <b>זְבוּלֻן</b><br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בַּשֵּׁבֶט שֶׁלִּי - כ 57 אֶלֶף אֲנָשִׁים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנַחְנוּ סוֹחֲרִים מְמֻלָּחִים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְחוֹנִים בְּצַד מִזְרָח&nbsp;</span>🏳️&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בְּהַנְהָגַת 🦁 יְהוּדָה.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"158\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">💧 <b>רְאוּבֵן</b><br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בַּשֵּׁבֶט שֶׁלִּי - כ 46 אֶלֶף אֲנָשִׁים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנַחְנוּ מְהִירִים כַּמַּיִם.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְחוֹנִים בְּצַד דָּרוֹם&nbsp;</span>🏁<span style=\"font-family: arial;\">.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"158\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🗡️ <b>שִׁמְעוֹן</b><br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בַּשֵּׁבֶט שֶׁלִּי - כ 59 אֶלֶף אֲנָשִׁים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנַחְנוּ נִלְחָמִים בְּעֹז.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְחוֹנִים בְּצַד דָּרוֹם&nbsp;</span>🏁&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בְּהַנְהָגַת 💧 רְאוּבֵן.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"158\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🏹 <b>גָּד<br /></b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בַּשֵּׁבֶט שֶׁלִּי - כ 45 אֶלֶף אֲנָשִׁים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנַחְנוּ לוֹחֲמִים מְעֻלִּים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְחוֹנִים בְּצַד דָּרוֹם&nbsp;</span>🏁&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בְּהַנְהָגַת 💧 רְאוּבֵן.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"158\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">🐂 <b>אֶפְרַיִם</b></span></p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"158\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בַּשֵּׁבֶט שֶׁלִּי - כ 40 אֶלֶף אֲנָשִׁים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנַחְנוּ חֲזָקִים וּמֻצְלָחִים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְחוֹנִים בְּצַד מַעֲרָב&nbsp;</span>🚩<span style=\"font-family: arial;\">.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"158\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🦏 <b>מְנַשֶּׁה<br /></b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בַּשֵּׁבֶט שֶׁלִּי - כ 32 אֶלֶף אֲנָשִׁים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנַחְנוּ גִּבּוֹרִים וּזְרִיזִים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְחוֹנִים בְּצַד מַעֲרָב&nbsp;</span>🚩&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בְּהַנְהָגַת 🐂 אֶפְרַיִם.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"158\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🐺 <b>בִּנְיָמִין</b><br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בַּשֵּׁבֶט שֶׁלִּי - כ 35 אֶלֶף אֲנָשִׁים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנַחְנוּ כְּמוֹ זְאֵבִים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְחוֹנִים בְּצַד מַעֲרָב&nbsp;</span>🚩&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בְּהַנְהָגַת 🐂 אֶפְרַיִם.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"158\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🐍 <b>דָּן<br /></b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בַּשֵּׁבֶט שֶׁלִּי - כ 62 אֶלֶף אֲנָשִׁים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנַחְנוּ אֲנָשִׁים שׁוֹפְטִים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְחוֹנִים בְּצַד צָפוֹן&nbsp;</span>🏴<span style=\"font-family: arial;\">.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"158\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🌳 <b>אָשֵׁר<br /></b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בַּשֵּׁבֶט שֶׁלִּי - כ 41 אֶלֶף אֲנָשִׁים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנַחְנוּ חַקְלָאִים וְיַצְרָנֵי שֶׁמֶן.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְחוֹנִים בְּצַד צָפוֹן&nbsp;</span>🏴&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בְּהַנְהָגַת 🐍 דָּן.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"242\" data-start=\"158\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🦌 <b>נַפְתָּלִי<br /></b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בַּשֵּׁבֶט שֶׁלִּי - כ 53 אֶלֶף אֲנָשִׁים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנַחְנוּ מְהִירֵי רַגְלַיִם.<br /></span><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְחוֹנִים בְּצַד צָפוֹן 🏴 בְּהַנְהָגַת 🐍 דָּן</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">.</span></span></p></div><div><h2><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">תפזורת נשיאים</span></h2></div><div><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span><span>מצאו את&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"font-weight: bold;\">🔍</strong><span>&nbsp;שמות הנשיאים: נַחְשׁוֹן, נְתַנְאֵל, אֱלִיאָב, אֱלִיצוּר, שְׁלֻמִיאֵל, אֶלְיָסָף, אֲבִידָן, אֲחִירַע.</span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בכיוונים&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">⬅️ ➡️ ⬇️ ⬆️</span></span><br /><br /><a href=\"/assets/images/content/9bd386722a82d0565c.png\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"/assets/images/content/9bd386722a82d0565c.png\" /></a><br /><h2 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">נכון או לא בפרשה?</span></h2></div><div><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עַם יִשְׂרָאֵל נִסְפַּר&nbsp;לְפִי הַשְּׁבָטִים?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">גַּם נָשִׁים וִילָדִים נִכְלְלוּ בַּמִּפְקָד?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כָּל שֵׁבֶט חָנָה בַּמָּקוֹם שֶׁבָּחַר לְעַצְמוֹ?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַמִּשְׁכָּן הָיָה בְּמֶרְכַּז מַחֲנֵה יִשְׂרָאֵל?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מַחֲנֵה יְהוּדָה חָנָה בְּצַד מִזְרָח?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מַחֲנֵה דָּן חָנָה בְּצַד דָּרוֹם?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לְכָל שֵׁבֶט הָיָה דֶּגֶל מִשֶּׁלּוֹ?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בְּנֵי לֵוִי חָנוּ סְבִיב הַמִּשְׁכָּן?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בְּנֵי לֵוִי נִכְלְלוּ בַּמִּפְקָד שֶׁל שְׁאָר הַשְּׁבָטִים?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כָּל הַלְּוִיִּים עָשׂוּ אֶת אוֹתָהּ עֲבוֹדָה?</span></li></ol></div>"
}
